      "writtenOn": "2023-07-12T17:48:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do mean that not all logic for boot image was available on master-art. All the code was in build/soong, of course, but some of them was for \"platform_bootclasspath\", and some of them was for \"bootclasspath_fragment\". Since \"platform_bootclasspath\" doesn\u0027t exist on master-art, the boot image logic for it cannot be executed there. Making all boot image logic available on master-art is the main motivation of making this change.",
      "parentUuid": "3c23b9f4_289d113b",
